  ┃  test result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s
  ┃

     Fixed. Timer::label divided the seconds by 60 a second time instead of taking the remainder.

     - src/timer.rs: self.seconds / 60 → self.seconds % 60
     - cargo test passes: formats_minutes_and_seconds now sees 1:30.                                                                                              ⬖ Getting started                ✕

     let minutes = self.seconds / 60;                                                                                                                               OpenCode includes free models so
     let seconds = self.seconds % 60;                                                                                                                               you can start immediately.

